ent-BaseBed = { ent-BaseStructure }
    .desc = { ent-BaseStructure.desc }
ent-Bed = 床 | bed
    .desc = 這可以用來躺臥、睡覺或綁在身上。在此休息可獲得極其緩慢的恢復效果。 | This is used to lie in, sleep in or strap on. Resting here provides extremely slow healing.
ent-MedicalBed = 醫療用病床 | medical bed
    .desc = 一張供患者休養的病床。在此休息可讓傷勢以相當緩慢的速度康復。 | A hospital bed for patients to recover in. Resting here provides fairly slow healing.
ent-DogBed = 狗床 | dog bed
    .desc = 一張看起來很舒適的狗床。萬一重力突然消失，你甚至可以將寵物綁在上面。 | A comfy-looking dog bed. You can even strap your pet in, in case the gravity turns off.
ent-Mattress = 床墊 | mattress
    .desc = 我想，睡在那裡總比睡在地板上好些吧。 | Better sleep in that then on the floor i guess.
ent-WebBed = 網床 | web bed
    .desc = 你被網住了。 | You got webbed.
ent-PsychBed = 心理學家專用床 | psychologist bed
    .desc = 一款用於患者心理照護的軟墊床。 | An upholstered bed for the psychological care of patients.
